## 🚀 Running

```bash
# Development mode (with auto-reload)
uvicorn server:app --reload --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000

# Production mode
uvicorn server:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 --workers 4
```

The API will be available at: `http://localhost:8000`

